  "description": "\"Once I enter university, I'll definitely study hard and change my life for the better!\" Kam Saham, a broke college freshman is bent on changing her life by pursuing Fashion Design. However, in a curious turn of event, she ends up pretending to be loaded amongst all the rich kids in high society (Hi-So). Will she get called out or could she somehow find love amidst this chaos? \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
